@startuml pool-swap
skinparamlocked dpiCommandLine 200
title Pool swap

<style>
activityDiagram {
  FontName Inter
  FontSize 13
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  activity {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor #64748B
    LineThickness 1
    RoundCorner 6
    FontColor #0F172A
    Padding 8
    Margin 7
  }
  arrow {
    LineColor #64748B
    LineThickness 1.2
    FontColor #4A5A6A
    FontSize 11
  }
  swimlane {
    LineColor #CBD5E1
    LineThickness 1
    FontColor #334155
    FontStyle bold
  }
  circle {
    BackgroundColor #334155
    LineColor #334155
  }
  note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor #CBD5E1
    FontColor #475569
    FontSize 11
  }
  .created {
    BackgroundColor #ECFDF5
    LineColor #34D399
    FontColor #065F46
  }
}
</style>

|#F5F3FF|trader\nParty|
|#F8FAFC|venueOperator\nParty|
|#EFF6FF|DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
|#FFF7ED|CIP-0112\nToken contracts · on-ledger|

|trader\nParty|
start
:Exercise **PoolAccess_RequestSwap**\non **PoolAccess**;
|DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
:Validate **KycAttestation**,\npool access and swap terms;
|CIP-0112\nToken contracts · on-ledger|
:Exercise **AllocationFactory_Allocate**\non **AllocationFactory**\n(trader input + receipt);
:Create **TokenAllocation** contracts\nLock input / authorize receipt; <<created>>
|DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
:Return **SwapRequest** record\nwith both allocation IDs;
-> separate transaction;
|CIP-0112\nToken contracts · on-ledger|
if (Allocations pending\nNext action?) then (recover after deadline)
  group Optional recovery\nUnsettled allocations after the deadline {
    |trader\nParty|
    :Exercise **PoolAccess_RecoverAllocations**\non **PoolAccess**;
    |DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
    :Validate access, KYC, trader,\npool and expired deadline;
    |CIP-0112\nToken contracts · on-ledger|
    :Exercise **Allocation_Withdraw**\non **Allocation**;
    stop
  }
else (settle before deadline)
endif

|venueOperator\nParty|
:Exercise **VenueDelegation_SettleBatch**\non **VenueDelegation**;
|DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
:Recheck **PoolAccess**\nand **KycAttestation**;
:Exercise **Pool_Swap**\non **Pool**\n(dvo + venueOperator);
while (Next swap in batch?) is (yes)
  :Price against current reserves\nCheck **minOut** and deadline;
  |CIP-0112\nToken contracts · on-ledger|
  :Exercise **AllocationFactory_Allocate**\non **AllocationFactory**\n(pool receipt + output);
  :Create pool **TokenAllocation** contracts; <<created>>
  :Exercise **SettlementFactory_SettleBatch**\non **SettlementFactory**\n(once per token);
  :Exercise **Allocation_Settle**\non **Allocation**;
  |DEX\nContracts · on-ledger|
  :Create **SwapReceipt**; <<created>>
endwhile (no)
:Archive **PoolState**;
:Create **PoolState**\nwith final reserves and holdings; <<created>>
stop
@enduml
